nd dining areas, creating a warm and inviting space for everyday living and entertaining. All the bedrooms are upstairs and the master suite includes a private bathroom and generous closet space, while the additional bedrooms share a hallway bathroom, which is ideal for family, guests, or a home office. A half bath is conveniently located downstairs for guests. Step outside and enjoy a peaceful outdoor setting, perfect for relaxing mornings or quiet evenings. Additional features include a 1-car attached garage with automatic opener and driveway parking. Residents of Bellalago enjoy access to resort-style community amenities, including a 24-hour guarded gate, clubhouse, community pools, water park, fitness center, tennis courts, walking trails, and playground. Conveniently located near shopping, dining, schools, and Central Florida's major attractions, this home offers comfort, lifestyle, and location. Offered as a 12-month renewable lease. Request your tour today and see all this lovely Bellalago townhome. No Rv's, or work trucks allowed. If your credit score is below 650 the last months rent will be required as additional deposit. we are the exclusive agents for this property - if you see it listed without our phone numbers or it's a scam - don't get taken in.","age_restricted":false,"income_restricted":false,"flags":[],"min_rent":2000,"images":[{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/84d2952bffe90b270ff777dbfb8303b4l-m1782583233r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["door","garage","house_view","patio","porch","front","incomplete","exterior"],"primary":true,"origins":[{"kind":"primary"},{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/84d2952bffe90b270ff777dbfb8303b4l-m1782583233s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/84d2952bffe90b270ff777dbfb8303b4l-m1782583233r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/84d2952bffe90b270ff777dbfb8303b4l-m644978456r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["bathroom"],"primary":false,"origins":[{"kind":"listing"},